 ∫™␀`␀`␀`␀␀“…” À`␀d␀␀µúÃa␀µßÍFa␀␀—@û␀␀a␀F¢b␀␀ﬁ—a␀␀a␀¢b␀a␀␀b␀a␀b␀␀a␀b␀a␀çb␀Ïµa␀␀b␀a␀b␀␀a␀b␀a␀—@û␀␀µF¢b␀a␀␀—@û␀␀¥F¢b␀␀a␀␀Kô␀␀a␀Kö␀␀(ÃÇC	$␀& +S0#+␀+␀c+␀+␀+␀IÁfunction BlowFish_Decrypt(ctx, left, right) {
          let Xl = left;
          let Xr = right;
          let temp;
          for (let i = N + 1; i > 1; --i) {
            Xl = Xl ^ ctx.pbox[i];
            Xr = F(ctx, Xl) ^ Xr;
            temp = Xl;
            Xl = Xr;
            Xr = temp;
          }
          temp = Xl;
          Xl = Xr;
          Xr = temp;
          Xr = Xr ^ ctx.pbox[1];
          Xl = Xl ^ ctx.pbox[0];
          return { left: Xl, right: Xr };
        }C
